> 💡 **Sr. QA Call-Out:** The three edge cases with the highest combined likelihood AND impact are **EC-02** (brand vs generic), **EC-06** (mobile safety), and **EC-10** (deductible disclaimer prominence). All three are near-certain to occur in real member usage and all three have direct compliance or liability consequences. None of them would be caught by a standard functional test pass — which is exactly why edge case testing exists. Recommend raising EC-06 and EC-10 as **sprint 14 blockers** given the 61% mobile traffic reality and Carelon's prior ACA audit history.
